  {
    "RowId": 39300,
    "Text": "Defeat Ellerete!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39301,
    "Text": "I'll lead the charge, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! You focus on healing!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39302,
    "Text": "My dear, sweet faerie apple... I'm afraid you've soured on me. Prepare to perish!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39303,
    "Text": "Hee hee! A little poison never killed any─ Oh, wait. I lied. Ah, well!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39304,
    "Text": "Ugh! We'll need this cleansed, and quickly!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39305,
    "Text": "For my next trick, I give you...a venomous gift to hurt what heals you! Ta-daaa!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39306,
    "Text": "Such terrible power..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39307,
    "Text": "Pesky pest problems call for alchemical solutions!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39308,
    "Text": "まずは、トラルのお姉さんから片付けてやるわ！\n超強力な麻痺毒で、ビリビリに痺れちゃえ～！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39309,
    "Text": "くっ、痺れて動けない……！\n<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>、エスナをお願い！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39310,
    "Text": "Time to break out the Ellerete special!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39311,
    "Text": "Those tonics are bound to take their toll if she's not careful..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39312,
    "Text": "Ooh, I know! Why don't we set your heads a-spinning?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39313,
    "Text": "Ahaha! What a marvelous mess you're in! If you don't hurry, it'll only get messier..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39314,
    "Text": "The hunt's only just begun, my dears! I've plenty more where that came from."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39315,
    "Text": "いけない、毒の塊が弾けそうだわ……！\n離れておきましょう！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39316,
    "Text": "Augh! M-My head..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39317,
    "Text": "I grow weary of your tenacity. Mammets, to your positions!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39318,
    "Text": "Nothing we can't handle. Let's turn them into scrap metal!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39319,
    "Text": "Oh, for the love of... Pull yourself together, Ellerete!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39320,
    "Text": "I-I'll be fine! Just a few more draughts..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39321,
    "Text": "Can you withstand this, I wonder!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39322,
    "Text": "幻覚の毒だわ、惑わされないように気をつけて！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39323,
    "Text": "\\\\<sigh> Desperate times, as they say... I'll summon the defective mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39324,
    "Text": "I'm sorry, the <i>what</i>!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39325,
    "Text": "うわぁーっ、こっちに来ないでくださいよーっ！！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39326,
    "Text": "仕方ない、こうなったら自爆させるしか……！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39327,
    "Text": "Ahaha! Poison here, poison there, poison, poison, everywhere!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39328,
    "Text": "Leave this to me, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>. Just keep an eye on Ellerete!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39329,
    "Text": "我が部族の秘技、その目に焼きつけなさい！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39330,
    "Text": "You are rotten to the core! Why do you persist!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39331,
    "Text": "Godsdamn it all..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39332,
    "Text": "I'll handle the rest, Kokonowa! Be a good little goldsmith and sit this out!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39333,
    "Text": "No, no, NO! My tonics... They've betrayed me!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39334,
    "Text": "Pesky pest problems call for alchemical solutions!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39335,
    "Text": "Stubborn worms! I will end you─<i>do you hear me</i>!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39400,
    "Text": "Arrive in Spineblossom"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39401,
    "Text": "Defeat the barreltender"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39402,
    "Text": "Arrive at the tremendous tank"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39403,
    "Text": "Defeat Anthracite"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39404,
    "Text": "Arrive at the Altar of the Urn Exulted"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39405,
    "Text": "Defeat the greatest serpent of Tural"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39406,
    "Text": "Open your eyes, and purge the sanctuary of this taint!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39407,
    "Text": "Guardians of the sanctuary─in the name of the great serpent, I bid you awaken!"
  },
